% D-0262, from the fuzz e2e stream (seed 8102 model 258): an objective over a FIXED variable,
% so cake's `min:` and baguette's are both empty. tools/e2e/bridge.py refused it ("cake's
% objective is not one variable's bit sum") and the bridged chain said FAIL; each `soli`'s
% improving row is now carried over unchanged. Unique solution: x = 1, o = 0.
var 1..2: x :: output_var;
var 0..0: o :: output_var;
constraint int_le(x,1);
solve maximize o;
